config XIAOMI_MIGT
	tristate "Xiaomi MiGameTurbo (6.18 aligned)"
	depends on ARM64 && ANDROID_VENDOR_HOOKS && ANDROID_VENDOR_OEM_DATA
	select XIAOMI_METIS
	default n
	help
	  Xiaomi MIGT game scheduling/frequency policy, aligned to the CCC
	  dash reconstruction (OS3.0.305 stock). Providers that stock
	  resolved in the closed scheduler are rebuilt: the game_migt slot
	  family and oem_freq live in metis (with 6.18 vendor-hook
	  bridges), sched_load_update in mi_schedule. Stock parameter
	  defaults keep every policy gate off until userspace opts in.
